# Seedglaive Mentor: "Vigilance, haste" and "Valiant - Whenever this creature becomes the target of a spell or ability you
# control for the first time each turn, put a +1/+1 counter on it." Turn 1: cast with haste, it attacks and, with vigilance,
# is not tapped by it (CR 702.20b). Turn 3: Rancor, a spell, targets it first - one counter - and then the Basilisk Collar's equip
# ability targets it again the same turn: that is the second time, so no second counter (CR 603.2). Turn 5: equipping again
# is the first time that turn, so a second counter comes. The triggers are Bot1's own targetings; an opponent's targeting is the
# other scenario.

